          "title": "You'll want to know: सफर",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सफर — saphar — \"a trip; a tour\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आम्ही होडीने बेटाची सफर केली. āmhī hoḍīne beṭācī saphar kelī. We took a trip to the island by boat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सफर (saphar) करणे, to make a trip; it sounds light and happy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सफर (saphar) is a loan through Persian, usually traced to Arabic safar, \"a journey\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
